1
00:00:00,960 --> 00:00:04,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YOSHINOBU]
Yaga, what is that thing?</b></font>

2
00:00:04,670 --> 00:00:07,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It is possible to have
man-made cursed corpses</b></font>

3
00:00:07,420 --> 00:00:08,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>act more autonomously</b></font>

4
00:00:08,630 --> 00:00:10,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>than other forms
of manipulation.</b></font>

5
00:00:11,050 --> 00:00:13,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But they're always powered by
consuming cursed energy</b></font>

6
00:00:13,810 --> 00:00:15,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from the sorcerer.</b></font>

7
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:18,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And yet, that thing
is sustaining itself</b></font>

8
00:00:18,310 --> 00:00:20,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>on its own cursed energy.</b></font>

9
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:24,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The higher-ups are currently
trying to designate you</b></font>

10
00:00:24,690 --> 00:00:25,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>as a special grade,</b></font>

11
00:00:26,190 --> 00:00:28,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and officially sentence you
to indefinite imprisonment.</b></font>

12
00:00:29,740 --> 00:00:33,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because if you can intentionally
create a thing like that,</b></font>

13
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:34,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>then it stands to reason</b></font>

14
00:00:34,370 --> 00:00:37,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you could easily
create your own army.</b></font>

15
00:00:37,870 --> 00:00:40,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So tell me, Yaga.</b></font>

16
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:45,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You truly have no idea of
how that thing was created?</b></font>

17
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:46,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is that your official stance?</b></font>

18
00:00:47,010 --> 00:00:48,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[water dripping]</b></font>

19
00:00:49,680 --> 00:00:50,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yes.</b></font>

20
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:53,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKERU] Masamichi.</b></font>

21
00:00:54,180 --> 00:00:56,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Everyone's worried about you.</b></font>

22
00:00:56,060 --> 00:00:57,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They told me you seem down.</b></font>

23
00:00:58,020 --> 00:00:59,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MASAMICHI] Did they?</b></font>

24
00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:01,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[insects trilling]</b></font>

25
00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:03,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKERU]
So I told them all this.</b></font>

26
00:01:03,860 --> 00:01:05,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If Masamichi is feeling down,</b></font>

27
00:01:05,610 --> 00:01:06,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we just have to cheer him up.</b></font>

28
00:01:09,360 --> 00:01:10,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is that so?</b></font>

29
00:01:11,360 --> 00:01:14,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Pretty smart, huh?
-[chuckles] Pretty smart.</b></font>

30
00:01:14,120 --> 00:01:15,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Takeru laughs]</b></font>

31
00:01:15,620 --> 00:01:16,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Takeru.</b></font>

32
00:01:16,910 --> 00:01:19,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm sorry, but I have
to leave home for a while.</b></font>

33
00:01:19,830 --> 00:01:22,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Would you please
let the others know for me?</b></font>

34
00:01:22,120 --> 00:01:23,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKERU] Leaving for work again?</b></font>

35
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:26,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's right.
It'll be a long trip too.</b></font>

36
00:01:26,960 --> 00:01:27,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't worry.</b></font>

37
00:01:28,010 --> 00:01:29,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This forest is still under</b></font>

38
00:01:29,340 --> 00:01:31,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the constant protection
of Tengen.</b></font>

39
00:01:31,590 --> 00:01:33,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And your mother will come soon.</b></font>

40
00:01:33,340 --> 00:01:35,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She'll be glad to see you.</b></font>

41
00:01:36,430 --> 00:01:38,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You'll be all right without me.</b></font>

42
00:01:38,770 --> 00:01:40,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm sure of it.</b></font>

43
00:01:42,770 --> 00:01:44,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKERU] Masamichi.</b></font>

44
00:01:45,190 --> 00:01:47,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It sure will be lonely
around here without you.</b></font>

45
00:01:47,860 --> 00:01:51,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sword clangs, scrapes]</b></font>

46
00:01:52,820 --> 00:01:55,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kusakabe, are you sure?</b></font>

47
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:58,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ATSUYA] Just don't go telling
anyone that I helped you.</b></font>

48
00:01:58,160 --> 00:02:00,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You were captured
to lure Yaga out.</b></font>

49
00:02:00,250 --> 00:02:01,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's all you need to know.</b></font>

50
00:02:02,410 --> 00:02:05,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Besides,
I owe that man a favor.</b></font>

51
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:08,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[drips]
-Go on. Get.</b></font>

52
00:02:09,760 --> 00:02:11,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Are you really sure about this?</b></font>

53
00:02:12,260 --> 00:02:14,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This thing is not your nephew.</b></font>

54
00:02:14,380 --> 00:02:17,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's just a vessel
with your nephew's information.</b></font>

55
00:02:17,550 --> 00:02:19,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Are you trying to tell me
that I can't live in the present</b></font>

56
00:02:19,930 --> 00:02:21,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if I stay hung up on the dead,</b></font>

57
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:23,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>forever living in the past?</b></font>

58
00:02:24,480 --> 00:02:28,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, my little sister can
no longer live in the past.</b></font>

59
00:02:28,270 --> 00:02:29,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She needs
to live in the present,</b></font>

60
00:02:29,980 --> 00:02:31,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>meaning with Takeru.</b></font>

61
00:02:35,490 --> 00:02:36,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Masamichi.</b></font>

62
00:02:36,950 --> 00:02:39,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I think that lady is my mother,
isn't she?</b></font>

63
00:02:40,200 --> 00:02:41,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MASAMICHI] That's right.</b></font>

64
00:02:41,500 --> 00:02:43,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Good job recognizing her.</b></font>

65
00:02:43,410 --> 00:02:45,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Takeru giggles]</b></font>

66
00:02:46,040 --> 00:02:48,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, I had a feeling
that's who she was.</b></font>

67
00:02:50,090 --> 00:02:51,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I must be a genius.</b></font>

68
00:02:54,970 --> 00:02:56,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[thuds]</b></font>

69
00:02:56,550 --> 00:02:59,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Atsuya's sister whimpering]</b></font>

70
00:02:59,510 --> 00:03:03,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[whimpering]</b></font>

71
00:03:03,180 --> 00:03:04,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ATSUYA'S SISTER] Takeru!</b></font>

72
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:10,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[crying]</b></font>

73
00:03:10,230 --> 00:03:11,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sorry, but...</b></font>

74
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:13,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't worry, I get it.</b></font>

75
00:03:13,690 --> 00:03:14,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You can't let anyone know</b></font>

76
00:03:15,030 --> 00:03:17,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that your fully autonomous
cursed corpses exist.</b></font>

77
00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:20,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So he can't live with her.</b></font>

78
00:03:20,080 --> 00:03:21,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm sorry.</b></font>

79
00:03:21,330 --> 00:03:23,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why are you apologizing?</b></font>

80
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:26,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thank you, by the way.</b></font>

81
00:03:26,920 --> 00:03:28,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I mean it.</b></font>

82
00:03:28,750 --> 00:03:30,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thank you.</b></font>

83
00:03:32,670 --> 00:03:34,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ASSASSIN] Principal Yaga?</b></font>

84
00:03:34,300 --> 00:03:37,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Where do you think you're going
without any cursed corpses?</b></font>

85
00:03:38,140 --> 00:03:39,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm going to see my son.</b></font>

86
00:03:39,850 --> 00:03:41,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ASSASSIN]
You've been sentenced to death,</b></font>

87
00:03:41,470 --> 00:03:43,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so I don't think so.</b></font>

88
00:03:43,180 --> 00:03:45,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But why not save your own life?</b></font>

89
00:03:45,270 --> 00:03:47,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They'll let you live
if you just tell them</b></font>

90
00:03:47,230 --> 00:03:48,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>how you create
those fully autonomous,</b></font>

91
00:03:49,020 --> 00:03:50,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>man-made cursed corpses.</b></font>

92
00:03:51,440 --> 00:03:53,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MASAMICHI]
You all sure got suddenly brave</b></font>

93
00:03:53,190 --> 00:03:55,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the moment Satoru Gojo is gone.</b></font>

94
00:03:55,490 --> 00:03:56,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[assassin scoffs]</b></font>

95
00:03:56,570 --> 00:03:58,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ electric guitar playing]</b></font>

96
00:04:18,260 --> 00:04:20,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Masamichi groans]</b></font>

97
00:04:20,640 --> 00:04:22,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[breathing shakily]</b></font>

98
00:04:25,390 --> 00:04:26,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[ASSASSIN] Principal.</b></font>

99
00:04:27,230 --> 00:04:30,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You may leave now.
I'll handle the rest by myself.</b></font>

100
00:04:30,600 --> 00:04:31,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Understood.</b></font>

101
00:04:32,730 --> 00:04:35,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MASAMICHI] First,
you use the body's information</b></font>

102
00:04:35,690 --> 00:04:38,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to reproduce
the soul's information.</b></font>

103
00:04:38,200 --> 00:04:39,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Then the soul's information</b></font>

104
00:04:40,030 --> 00:04:43,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is placed inside
the cursed corpse's core.</b></font>

105
00:04:45,200 --> 00:04:47,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[Panda panting]
-But that's not enough.</b></font>

106
00:04:47,450 --> 00:04:48,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You have to place cores</b></font>

107
00:04:48,870 --> 00:04:51,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that house three
highly compatible souls</b></font>

108
00:04:51,500 --> 00:04:53,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>into a single cursed corpse.</b></font>

109
00:04:53,460 --> 00:04:55,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Then force those souls</b></font>

110
00:04:55,500 --> 00:04:57,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to observe each other
at all times.</b></font>

111
00:04:57,920 --> 00:04:59,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Once you do that step,</b></font>

112
00:04:59,760 --> 00:05:02,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it finally allows
the souls to stabilize,</b></font>

113
00:05:02,510 --> 00:05:04,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so self-awareness can take root.</b></font>

114
00:05:04,550 --> 00:05:06,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Roughly three months
after that's born,</b></font>

115
00:05:06,640 --> 00:05:09,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it will begin supplying
its own cursed energy.</b></font>

116
00:05:09,350 --> 00:05:11,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why talk now?</b></font>

117
00:05:12,310 --> 00:05:15,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why are you sharing this
with us now?</b></font>

118
00:05:15,610 --> 00:05:17,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why not tell us sooner?</b></font>

119
00:05:18,190 --> 00:05:20,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why not try to live longer?</b></font>

120
00:05:21,490 --> 00:05:24,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because it's... it's a curse,</b></font>

121
00:05:24,530 --> 00:05:26,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Principal Gakuganji.</b></font>

122
00:05:26,950 --> 00:05:31,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's a curse that is handed down
from me to you.</b></font>

123
00:05:34,210 --> 00:05:36,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps] Masamichi!</b></font>

124
00:05:36,130 --> 00:05:39,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

125
00:05:46,470 --> 00:05:48,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YOSHINOBU]
Why don't you fight me?</b></font>

126
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:51,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I assume you hate me enough
to kill me.</b></font>

127
00:05:51,390 --> 00:05:53,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[PANDA] Pandas aren't
bound by things like that.</b></font>

128
00:05:54,650 --> 00:05:57,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Besides, you were never
on bad terms with Masamichi.</b></font>

129
00:05:59,190 --> 00:06:01,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>To me, you're just
the random knife</b></font>

130
00:06:01,280 --> 00:06:02,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that happened to fall upon him.</b></font>

131
00:06:04,740 --> 00:06:05,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But still,</b></font>

132
00:06:05,740 --> 00:06:07,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>just make sure
you remember this.</b></font>

133
00:06:08,370 --> 00:06:12,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Even pandas can cry.</b></font>

134
00:06:12,960 --> 00:06:19,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[crying]</b></font>

135
00:06:20,210 --> 00:06:22,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ opening theme song playing]</b></font>

136
00:06:54,410 --> 00:06:58,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>JUJUTSU KAISEN</b></font>

137
00:07:50,260 --> 00:07:52,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kinji Hakari is currently
running a fight club</b></font>

138
00:07:52,890 --> 00:07:55,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in an old parking garage
in Tochigi Prefecture,</b></font>

139
00:07:55,640 --> 00:07:57,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>where he also acts as bookie.</b></font>

140
00:07:57,770 --> 00:07:58,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] A fight club?</b></font>

141
00:07:59,350 --> 00:08:01,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TENGEN] They host fist fights
between sorcerers.</b></font>

142
00:08:01,940 --> 00:08:04,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And the spectators are?</b></font>

143
00:08:04,070 --> 00:08:06,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TENGEN]
Generally non-sorcerers.</b></font>

144
00:08:06,950 --> 00:08:09,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] That blatantly
violates the secrecy mandated</b></font>

145
00:08:09,360 --> 00:08:11,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in Article Eight
of the Jujutsu Code.</b></font>

146
00:08:11,620 --> 00:08:15,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There are probably curse users
among the participants as well.</b></font>

147
00:08:15,160 --> 00:08:17,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So above all, be careful.</b></font>

148
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:18,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuji gasps softly]</b></font>

149
00:08:19,250 --> 00:08:20,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Why are we changing?</b></font>

150
00:08:21,380 --> 00:08:22,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Hakari was expelled</b></font>

151
00:08:22,420 --> 00:08:24,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for clashing
with the upper brass.</b></font>

152
00:08:24,380 --> 00:08:27,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's also actively
violating jujutsu regulations.</b></font>

153
00:08:27,880 --> 00:08:30,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If he finds out we're
with Jujutsu High, he might run.</b></font>

154
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:32,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's like we're cops
and he's the robber.</b></font>

155
00:08:34,010 --> 00:08:36,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh? We're on
Jujutsu High's side now?</b></font>

156
00:08:36,850 --> 00:08:39,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Megumi sighs]
We're in a gray zone.</b></font>

157
00:08:39,100 --> 00:08:41,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But in Hakari's eyes,
at least, yeah.</b></font>

158
00:08:41,650 --> 00:08:43,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Is he even likely
to cooperate with us?</b></font>

159
00:08:44,020 --> 00:08:45,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] I'm not sure.</b></font>

160
00:08:45,280 --> 00:08:47,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All our teachers say
he's a good-for-nothing.</b></font>

161
00:08:49,860 --> 00:08:51,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But Okkotsu claimed</b></font>

162
00:08:51,200 --> 00:08:53,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hakari has the potential
to be stronger than him.</b></font>

163
00:08:53,490 --> 00:08:55,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We definitely want his strength.</b></font>

164
00:08:55,620 --> 00:08:57,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHRIMP]
You brats better get on home.</b></font>

165
00:08:57,500 --> 00:08:59,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is no place for you guys
to be hanging out.</b></font>

166
00:08:59,790 --> 00:09:02,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MACHO] You have until the count
of three to turn around.</b></font>

167
00:09:02,290 --> 00:09:04,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>After that,
I start swinging my fists.</b></font>

168
00:09:05,300 --> 00:09:06,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We need money.</b></font>

169
00:09:06,800 --> 00:09:08,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Let us join your little
fight club so we can earn some.</b></font>

170
00:09:08,970 --> 00:09:10,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Macho grunts]</b></font>

171
00:09:11,550 --> 00:09:13,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MACHO]
The first rule of our fight club</b></font>

172
00:09:13,970 --> 00:09:16,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is that you do not
talk about our fight club.</b></font>

173
00:09:17,470 --> 00:09:19,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Who blabbed?
And where can I find him?</b></font>

174
00:09:19,810 --> 00:09:21,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If I like what you say,
I won't beat you up.</b></font>

175
00:09:21,980 --> 00:09:24,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I never learned his name.
I killed him.</b></font>

176
00:09:25,650 --> 00:09:27,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It was about a month ago.</b></font>

177
00:09:27,150 --> 00:09:29,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just some scumbag
who was all talk.</b></font>

178
00:09:29,570 --> 00:09:32,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHRIMP] Kondo
disappeared about a month ago.</b></font>

179
00:09:33,370 --> 00:09:35,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[MEGUMI] I can take his slot.
-[cell phone ringing]</b></font>

180
00:09:35,530 --> 00:09:37,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Or if you prefer,
I can just beat you to a pulp</b></font>

181
00:09:37,740 --> 00:09:38,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in front of your boss.</b></font>

182
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:40,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Oh, yeah.</b></font>

183
00:09:40,250 --> 00:09:42,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He'd be wary if we
suddenly asked to see him.</b></font>

184
00:09:42,460 --> 00:09:44,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I guess we shouldn't know
his name's Hakari, either.</b></font>

185
00:09:44,920 --> 00:09:46,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Time to zip the lips.</b></font>

186
00:09:46,710 --> 00:09:47,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHRIMP] Are you sure?</b></font>

187
00:09:48,760 --> 00:09:50,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's enough!</b></font>

188
00:09:50,050 --> 00:09:52,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The boss is giving you
the go-ahead.</b></font>

189
00:09:52,590 --> 00:09:55,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're lucky one of our fighters
just dropped out.</b></font>

190
00:09:55,470 --> 00:09:56,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>One thing, though.</b></font>

191
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:58,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your friend's the one
who's fighting.</b></font>

192
00:09:59,640 --> 00:10:02,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[YUJI] Hm?
-[MEGUMI] That's good for us.</b></font>

193
00:10:02,060 --> 00:10:04,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Itadori's better suited
for this kind of thing.</b></font>

194
00:10:04,690 --> 00:10:06,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No chance. I fight.</b></font>

195
00:10:06,690 --> 00:10:09,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SHRIMP] The boss said
he doesn't like you.</b></font>

196
00:10:09,070 --> 00:10:12,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And if you don't like it,
then the deal's off.</b></font>

197
00:10:13,030 --> 00:10:15,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If that's the case, he'll fight.</b></font>

198
00:10:15,410 --> 00:10:16,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Fushiguro, that was risky.</b></font>

199
00:10:16,870 --> 00:10:18,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Your bluffs go
too far sometimes.</b></font>

200
00:10:19,540 --> 00:10:20,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] You worry too much.</b></font>

201
00:10:21,250 --> 00:10:24,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If curse users are participating
in the fight club too,</b></font>

202
00:10:24,170 --> 00:10:25,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that means there must be
decent turnover.</b></font>

203
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:28,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] The curse users
are here, all right.</b></font>

204
00:10:28,670 --> 00:10:31,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If he was watching us
through security cameras,</b></font>

205
00:10:32,050 --> 00:10:34,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>then there's a high chance
Hakari is in there as well.</b></font>

206
00:10:34,970 --> 00:10:37,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You snoop around
from the inside, Itadori.</b></font>

207
00:10:37,800 --> 00:10:40,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>In the meantime, I'm gonna
check out that parking lot.</b></font>

208
00:10:40,930 --> 00:10:42,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Maybe.
-[YUJI] Maybe?</b></font>

209
00:10:42,770 --> 00:10:44,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI]
He's ignoring me for now.</b></font>

210
00:10:44,640 --> 00:10:47,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If Hakari learns we're trying
to infiltrate his club,</b></font>

211
00:10:47,190 --> 00:10:48,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we'll lose his trust
and our opportunity</b></font>

212
00:10:48,730 --> 00:10:50,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to make contact with him.</b></font>

213
00:10:50,440 --> 00:10:53,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Well, we'll just resort
to force if that happens.</b></font>

214
00:10:53,570 --> 00:10:56,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That really should be
our last resort.</b></font>

215
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:57,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're here for one thing,</b></font>

216
00:10:57,740 --> 00:11:00,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to ask Hakari for
his cooperation in joining us.</b></font>

217
00:11:00,830 --> 00:11:03,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd like to avoid
harming any future alliances.</b></font>

218
00:11:04,410 --> 00:11:05,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>To be honest,</b></font>

219
00:11:05,790 --> 00:11:07,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't think I should be
doing anything tonight.</b></font>

220
00:11:07,880 --> 00:11:09,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I don't wanna waste
the time we do have</b></font>

221
00:11:09,630 --> 00:11:11,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>until Tsumiki
is forced to participate</b></font>

222
00:11:11,590 --> 00:11:12,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in the culling game.</b></font>

223
00:11:13,630 --> 00:11:16,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Right now,
it's 5:00 p.m. on the tenth.</b></font>

224
00:11:16,970 --> 00:11:18,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So nine days until the deadline.</b></font>

225
00:11:18,760 --> 00:11:20,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I guess it took us longer
to get here</b></font>

226
00:11:20,390 --> 00:11:22,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>than we originally
thought it would.</b></font>

227
00:11:22,770 --> 00:11:25,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] That's why I'll be
looking for Hakari tonight.</b></font>

228
00:11:26,350 --> 00:11:28,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But if it looks too risky,
I'll pull out.</b></font>

229
00:11:28,980 --> 00:11:30,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's why I said maybe.</b></font>

230
00:11:30,610 --> 00:11:31,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Got it.</b></font>

231
00:11:33,440 --> 00:11:35,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MACHO]
There are only two rules.</b></font>

232
00:11:35,070 --> 00:11:38,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No running away,
and no using curse techniques.</b></font>

233
00:11:38,070 --> 00:11:40,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How come? I don't mind if
they're using curse techniques.</b></font>

234
00:11:40,990 --> 00:11:42,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It won't help 'em.</b></font>

235
00:11:42,370 --> 00:11:43,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MACHO] Because most
of the crowd are non-sorcerers</b></font>

236
00:11:43,950 --> 00:11:45,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and can't see them.</b></font>

237
00:11:45,910 --> 00:11:48,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A fight no one can see sucks.</b></font>

238
00:11:48,290 --> 00:11:49,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And the "no running" rule?</b></font>

239
00:11:50,340 --> 00:11:52,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MACHO] It means you fight where
the spectators can see you.</b></font>

240
00:11:53,590 --> 00:11:55,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] It's all about
the spectators, huh?</b></font>

241
00:11:55,760 --> 00:11:58,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They paid to get in.
Business 101.</b></font>

242
00:11:58,930 --> 00:12:00,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So what's the boss like?</b></font>

243
00:12:01,390 --> 00:12:02,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Curious, huh?</b></font>

244
00:12:03,430 --> 00:12:04,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, yeah.</b></font>

245
00:12:05,430 --> 00:12:06,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MACHO]
You'll know if you meet him.</b></font>

246
00:12:06,810 --> 00:12:08,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] If, or when?</b></font>

247
00:12:08,810 --> 00:12:10,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MACHO] There are
two kinds of matches.</b></font>

248
00:12:10,650 --> 00:12:12,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Real beat-downs
like today's tournament,</b></font>

249
00:12:12,860 --> 00:12:14,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and fixed bouts.</b></font>

250
00:12:14,400 --> 00:12:16,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The boss writes
the script for those.</b></font>

251
00:12:17,990 --> 00:12:21,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He might call for you if
you manage to shine out there.</b></font>

252
00:12:21,740 --> 00:12:22,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're saying, to meet the boss,</b></font>

253
00:12:22,990 --> 00:12:24,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I just need to
put on a good show?</b></font>

254
00:12:25,160 --> 00:12:27,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You really can't make things
much simpler than that.</b></font>

255
00:12:36,760 --> 00:12:38,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MACHO] Over there,</b></font>

256
00:12:38,130 --> 00:12:39,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that's your opponent for today.</b></font>

257
00:12:41,970 --> 00:12:43,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[gasps]
-I was blown away</b></font>

258
00:12:43,430 --> 00:12:45,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the first time I saw him, too.</b></font>

259
00:12:45,270 --> 00:12:46,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah.</b></font>

260
00:12:47,100 --> 00:12:50,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It really is all about
drawing in the crowd.</b></font>

261
00:12:52,110 --> 00:12:53,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Are you ready to get it started?</b></font>

262
00:12:53,860 --> 00:12:57,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because it's time for the
Gachinko Fight Club Tournament!</b></font>

263
00:12:57,530 --> 00:12:58,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hello, everybody!</b></font>

264
00:12:58,820 --> 00:13:01,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm your commentator
for the night, John Bobby!</b></font>

265
00:13:01,360 --> 00:13:03,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Allow me to introduce
tonight's exciting matchup!</b></font>

266
00:13:04,030 --> 00:13:05,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're joined by
a sudden upstart.</b></font>

267
00:13:06,040 --> 00:13:08,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Will he rise up or burn out?</b></font>

268
00:13:08,540 --> 00:13:10,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's the dangerous fireball kid,</b></font>

269
00:13:10,870 --> 00:13:14,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Yuji Itadori!
-[crowd cheering]</b></font>

270
00:13:14,460 --> 00:13:16,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[JOHN] His opponent
stands like a panda,</b></font>

271
00:13:16,300 --> 00:13:17,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>sits like a panda,</b></font>

272
00:13:17,460 --> 00:13:18,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and walks like a panda!</b></font>

273
00:13:18,970 --> 00:13:21,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Please welcome Panda!</b></font>

274
00:13:21,970 --> 00:13:24,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now, place your bets!
Place your bets!</b></font>

275
00:13:24,550 --> 00:13:26,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Everyone ready to rumble?!</b></font>

276
00:13:26,930 --> 00:13:29,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HAKARI] I can feel
my passion draining away.</b></font>

277
00:13:30,310 --> 00:13:32,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What's wrong, my sweet baby?</b></font>

278
00:13:32,690 --> 00:13:35,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If one is lucky,
then he's meant to be tested.</b></font>

279
00:13:36,020 --> 00:13:37,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's boring to gamble</b></font>

280
00:13:37,400 --> 00:13:39,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>when you know who'll win
from the start.</b></font>

281
00:13:39,650 --> 00:13:41,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There aren't
many stray sorcerers</b></font>

282
00:13:41,320 --> 00:13:43,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who are tough enough
to beat Panda.</b></font>

283
00:13:43,490 --> 00:13:45,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[JOHN] Whoa!</b></font>

284
00:13:45,370 --> 00:13:47,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KIRARA] Looks like
you might be wrong.</b></font>

285
00:13:47,240 --> 00:13:48,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HAKARI] Huh?</b></font>

286
00:13:48,540 --> 00:13:50,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>FIGHTING ARENA
2ND FLOOR CH 6</b></font>

287
00:13:50,830 --> 00:13:52,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ exciting music playing]</b></font>

288
00:13:52,870 --> 00:13:54,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Panda,
have you seen Hakari yet?</b></font>

289
00:13:56,130 --> 00:13:57,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No.</b></font>

290
00:13:57,460 --> 00:13:58,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>TAP</b></font>

291
00:13:59,090 --> 00:14:01,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[roaring]</b></font>

292
00:14:01,510 --> 00:14:03,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's not suspicious of me
'cause we know each other,</b></font>

293
00:14:03,800 --> 00:14:05,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but he's avoiding me.</b></font>

294
00:14:06,100 --> 00:14:07,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>TAP TAP TAP TAP</b></font>

295
00:14:07,310 --> 00:14:10,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>ROOOAR</b></font>

296
00:14:11,020 --> 00:14:12,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Meanwhile,
the other third-year's technique</b></font>

297
00:14:13,020 --> 00:14:14,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is also going to be a problem.</b></font>

298
00:14:18,110 --> 00:14:19,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[crowd cheering]</b></font>

299
00:14:23,280 --> 00:14:25,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[PANDA] I hope
you're hiding the fact</b></font>

300
00:14:25,070 --> 00:14:26,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that you're from Jujutsu High!</b></font>

301
00:14:26,740 --> 00:14:28,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Of course! [gasps]</b></font>

302
00:14:28,700 --> 00:14:31,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[PANDA] Good.
You know what to do now, right?</b></font>

303
00:14:33,250 --> 00:14:34,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

304
00:14:37,630 --> 00:14:38,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Whoa!</b></font>

305
00:14:38,750 --> 00:14:40,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is definitely the best bout</b></font>

306
00:14:40,420 --> 00:14:42,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in my career as a commentator!</b></font>

307
00:14:42,800 --> 00:14:45,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Even if I have only been one
for the last two weeks!</b></font>

308
00:14:46,260 --> 00:14:47,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

309
00:14:50,560 --> 00:14:51,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>TAP</b></font>

310
00:14:53,310 --> 00:14:54,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>TAP</b></font>

311
00:14:55,690 --> 00:14:56,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>TAP</b></font>

312
00:14:57,360 --> 00:15:02,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[yelling]</b></font>

313
00:15:04,320 --> 00:15:05,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>TAP</b></font>

314
00:15:05,450 --> 00:15:07,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Panda yelling]</b></font>

315
00:15:07,700 --> 00:15:09,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

316
00:15:09,870 --> 00:15:10,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

317
00:15:11,200 --> 00:15:14,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[JOHN] The winner, Itadori!</b></font>

318
00:15:14,250 --> 00:15:15,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[crowd cheering]</b></font>

319
00:15:15,500 --> 00:15:16,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey!</b></font>

320
00:15:16,620 --> 00:15:18,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That punch was a foul!</b></font>

321
00:15:18,710 --> 00:15:22,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wait, I know.
I'm gonna call the SPCA on you!</b></font>

322
00:15:23,340 --> 00:15:24,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Your acting sucks.</b></font>

323
00:15:24,550 --> 00:15:26,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HAKARI]
Send Itadori up to the roof</b></font>

324
00:15:26,340 --> 00:15:28,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>after he wins the tournament.</b></font>

325
00:15:28,050 --> 00:15:30,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[MACHO] Huh?
-[HAKARI] He's sure to win it.</b></font>

326
00:15:30,220 --> 00:15:32,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Plus, he's intentionally
fighting in three dimensions</b></font>

327
00:15:32,770 --> 00:15:35,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to wow the spectators
in the upper rafters.</b></font>

328
00:15:35,520 --> 00:15:37,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can write a good script
with him.</b></font>

329
00:15:37,770 --> 00:15:39,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And like I always say...</b></font>

330
00:15:40,400 --> 00:15:43,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you have to strike
while the iron is hot!</b></font>

331
00:15:43,940 --> 00:15:46,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've asked you to use a coaster
a hundred times.</b></font>

332
00:15:46,240 --> 00:15:48,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MACHO] Got it.
And what about his buddy,</b></font>

333
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:49,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the other brat who didn't fight?</b></font>

334
00:15:49,950 --> 00:15:52,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Continue to keep
a close eye on him.</b></font>

335
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:54,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll send Kirara later
as backup.</b></font>

336
00:15:54,250 --> 00:15:55,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

337
00:15:55,370 --> 00:15:57,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm feeling a buzz right now</b></font>

338
00:15:57,160 --> 00:15:59,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that I haven't felt
in a long time.</b></font>

339
00:15:59,460 --> 00:16:00,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I haven't felt this alive</b></font>

340
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:03,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>since my ex maxed out
my credit cards.</b></font>

341
00:16:03,210 --> 00:16:05,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've asked you a million times
not to mention your ex.</b></font>

342
00:16:05,880 --> 00:16:06,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>KINJI HAKARI
KIRARA HOSHI</b></font>

343
00:16:08,550 --> 00:16:09,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Things are looking good.</b></font>

344
00:16:09,970 --> 00:16:13,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It won't be too long before
Itadori and Hakari meet.</b></font>

345
00:16:13,430 --> 00:16:14,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Tell me, Panda,</b></font>

346
00:16:14,970 --> 00:16:17,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>why haven't you been able
to see Hakari yet?</b></font>

347
00:16:17,350 --> 00:16:20,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hm. Well, I do know
where he likes to stay.</b></font>

348
00:16:20,400 --> 00:16:22,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>In the monitor room on the roof.</b></font>

349
00:16:22,610 --> 00:16:24,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I haven't been able
to get close enough.</b></font>

350
00:16:25,570 --> 00:16:26,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wait, why not?</b></font>

351
00:16:26,900 --> 00:16:28,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Even when I approached the door,</b></font>

352
00:16:28,280 --> 00:16:30,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't seem to
close the distance.</b></font>

353
00:16:30,200 --> 00:16:33,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The sensation feels similar
to Satoru's technique.</b></font>

354
00:16:33,660 --> 00:16:36,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's probably
due to Kirara's technique.</b></font>

355
00:16:36,830 --> 00:16:38,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Kirara?</b></font>

356
00:16:38,210 --> 00:16:40,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I thought the other
third-year student is a guy.</b></font>

357
00:16:40,920 --> 00:16:42,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, so what?</b></font>

358
00:16:42,080 --> 00:16:43,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So this.</b></font>

359
00:16:43,130 --> 00:16:44,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Does that phenomenon only occur</b></font>

360
00:16:44,500 --> 00:16:46,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>when Kirara's
in the monitor room?</b></font>

361
00:16:46,710 --> 00:16:47,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm not sure.</b></font>

362
00:16:48,130 --> 00:16:50,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've been focusing too much
on being a circus panda</b></font>

363
00:16:50,380 --> 00:16:52,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>instead of pushing more
and making them run off.</b></font>

364
00:16:52,600 --> 00:16:55,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm just really glad
the two of you showed up.</b></font>

365
00:16:55,470 --> 00:16:58,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do you think Itadori has
a chance to persuade him?</b></font>

366
00:16:58,140 --> 00:16:59,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It'll be tough.</b></font>

367
00:16:59,600 --> 00:17:02,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But it's just a matter of time
before he does.</b></font>

368
00:17:02,060 --> 00:17:04,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I think Itadori's light,
charming personality</b></font>

369
00:17:04,400 --> 00:17:06,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is a good match for
someone like Hakari.</b></font>

370
00:17:06,530 --> 00:17:08,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But you won't believe
how bad his acting sucks.</b></font>

371
00:17:08,950 --> 00:17:10,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI]
He doesn't just suck at it,</b></font>

372
00:17:10,990 --> 00:17:13,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>he struggles
to even see lying as an option.</b></font>

373
00:17:13,370 --> 00:17:14,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, that explains it.</b></font>

374
00:17:14,530 --> 00:17:16,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But it didn't stop him
from talking trash</b></font>

375
00:17:16,410 --> 00:17:17,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>about my acting.</b></font>

376
00:17:17,750 --> 00:17:20,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Anyway, once Itadori enters
the monitor room,</b></font>

377
00:17:20,460 --> 00:17:22,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll buy him time
by taking control of the place.</b></font>

378
00:17:22,790 --> 00:17:24,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Megumi gasps] Are you sure?</b></font>

379
00:17:24,210 --> 00:17:25,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[PANDA] Don't worry about it.</b></font>

380
00:17:25,550 --> 00:17:26,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Everything will be fine.</b></font>

381
00:17:26,960 --> 00:17:29,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I know where all the cameras
and their blind spots are.</b></font>

382
00:17:29,630 --> 00:17:31,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How many guards are in there?</b></font>

383
00:17:31,220 --> 00:17:32,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Four at the entrance</b></font>

384
00:17:32,550 --> 00:17:35,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and two on each floor
except for up on the roof.</b></font>

385
00:17:37,350 --> 00:17:39,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Okay, we can handle that.</b></font>

386
00:17:39,850 --> 00:17:42,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The only real concern
is Kirara's technique.</b></font>

387
00:17:42,350 --> 00:17:44,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[PANDA] We can't do
anything about that now.</b></font>

388
00:17:44,360 --> 00:17:47,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If they can warp Itadori
out of there or warp in backup,</b></font>

389
00:17:48,030 --> 00:17:50,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we'll give up
on pursuing Hakari.</b></font>

390
00:17:51,070 --> 00:17:52,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wow, you look so young.</b></font>

391
00:17:52,740 --> 00:17:54,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Are you still a first-year,
Yu-ie?</b></font>

392
00:17:54,820 --> 00:17:55,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yu-ie?</b></font>

393
00:17:56,200 --> 00:17:58,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KIRARA] Kin had to repeat
a year in middle school.</b></font>

394
00:17:58,540 --> 00:18:00,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Looks like
you have a happy life here.</b></font>

395
00:18:00,500 --> 00:18:02,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Kirara laughs] Well, yeah.</b></font>

396
00:18:02,620 --> 00:18:04,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's been a while
since Kin's gotten</b></font>

397
00:18:04,920 --> 00:18:06,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>all heated up like this, though.</b></font>

398
00:18:07,210 --> 00:18:11,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You see, I simply love it
when Kin is passionate.</b></font>

399
00:18:12,930 --> 00:18:14,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[door shuts]</b></font>

400
00:18:16,350 --> 00:18:17,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HAKARI] Itadori.</b></font>

401
00:18:17,640 --> 00:18:19,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Would you believe me if I said</b></font>

402
00:18:19,850 --> 00:18:21,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you can earn
a million yen a month</b></font>

403
00:18:21,600 --> 00:18:24,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>by doing something that
takes only an hour a day to do?</b></font>

404
00:18:25,560 --> 00:18:29,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Well, I guess it depends
on what that something is.</b></font>

405
00:18:29,860 --> 00:18:32,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But you'll have to pay me
200,000 yen</b></font>

406
00:18:32,320 --> 00:18:34,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to buy the information
on what that something is.</b></font>

407
00:18:34,950 --> 00:18:36,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

408
00:18:36,370 --> 00:18:38,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>In that case,
I don't believe you.</b></font>

409
00:18:38,410 --> 00:18:40,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Good. Because just
like you suspected,</b></font>

410
00:18:40,660 --> 00:18:43,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was presenting you
with a classic con.</b></font>

411
00:18:43,250 --> 00:18:45,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The swindler
pretends to be rich,</b></font>

412
00:18:45,040 --> 00:18:46,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>selling the means to be rich</b></font>

413
00:18:46,380 --> 00:18:48,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to those desperate
to be rich in a classic scam,</b></font>

414
00:18:48,960 --> 00:18:51,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's obvious if you
think about it logically,</b></font>

415
00:18:51,380 --> 00:18:54,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but there's a huge number
of fools who fall for it.</b></font>

416
00:18:54,340 --> 00:18:55,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And you know why?</b></font>

417
00:18:55,640 --> 00:18:58,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>'Cause it all
has to do with passion.</b></font>

418
00:18:58,140 --> 00:18:59,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Passion?</b></font>

419
00:18:59,430 --> 00:19:02,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Both swindler and swindled
have the same passion.</b></font>

420
00:19:02,220 --> 00:19:04,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They both have
a compulsive drive</b></font>

421
00:19:04,180 --> 00:19:06,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to change their lives
for the better.</b></font>

422
00:19:06,690 --> 00:19:10,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>People high on passion
lose sight of their judgment.</b></font>

423
00:19:10,110 --> 00:19:12,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yet without passion,
no one in the world</b></font>

424
00:19:12,190 --> 00:19:13,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>would ever fall in love.</b></font>

425
00:19:13,950 --> 00:19:16,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I love that obsessive passion.</b></font>

426
00:19:17,240 --> 00:19:21,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do you know the most direct way
people deal with passion?</b></font>

427
00:19:21,830 --> 00:19:23,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Gambling?</b></font>

428
00:19:23,370 --> 00:19:25,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[laughs]</b></font>

429
00:19:26,290 --> 00:19:29,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>First time I saw you,
I knew you would get it.</b></font>

430
00:19:29,590 --> 00:19:31,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>After all, life is a gamble.</b></font>

431
00:19:31,880 --> 00:19:34,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I can't tell you the number
of women that have dumped me</b></font>

432
00:19:34,380 --> 00:19:35,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>because they hate gambling.</b></font>

433
00:19:35,800 --> 00:19:38,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I think they're the ones
who've got it all wrong.</b></font>

434
00:19:38,800 --> 00:19:41,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Our society throws out
those who can't bet big,</b></font>

435
00:19:41,600 --> 00:19:43,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>as well as those who don't know
when to fold their hands</b></font>

436
00:19:43,720 --> 00:19:45,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and call it a night.</b></font>

437
00:19:45,180 --> 00:19:48,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There isn't a single person
alive who doesn't gamble.</b></font>

438
00:19:48,350 --> 00:19:50,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What people hate
isn't the gambling.</b></font>

439
00:19:50,400 --> 00:19:53,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's the losing
and the being ruined forever.</b></font>

440
00:19:54,280 --> 00:19:55,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There must be some people</b></font>

441
00:19:55,530 --> 00:19:57,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who just wanna
live a peaceful life.</b></font>

442
00:19:57,610 --> 00:20:00,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not anyone that I've ever met.</b></font>

443
00:20:00,320 --> 00:20:03,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All the people that I know
love passion above all.</b></font>

444
00:20:03,620 --> 00:20:07,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Passion equals gambling,
and gambling equals life.</b></font>

445
00:20:07,830 --> 00:20:10,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And love equals control.</b></font>

446
00:20:10,330 --> 00:20:12,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And I wanna control
this nation's passion</b></font>

447
00:20:13,000 --> 00:20:14,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>through my fight club one day.</b></font>

448
00:20:15,550 --> 00:20:17,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>With the existence
of curses going public</b></font>

449
00:20:18,010 --> 00:20:19,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and headquarters
barely able to function,</b></font>

450
00:20:19,890 --> 00:20:22,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>this is my chance
to expand the business.</b></font>

451
00:20:22,600 --> 00:20:24,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm going to crush
the opposition,</b></font>

452
00:20:24,890 --> 00:20:27,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and I'll make them
publicly recognize my fight club</b></font>

453
00:20:27,640 --> 00:20:31,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in the coming revisions
to the jujutsu regulations.</b></font>

454
00:20:31,110 --> 00:20:32,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And to do that,</b></font>

455
00:20:32,820 --> 00:20:34,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll need a strong player
on my team.</b></font>

456
00:20:36,440 --> 00:20:37,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Itadori,</b></font>

457
00:20:38,490 --> 00:20:41,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>how do you feel about
getting high on my passion?</b></font>

458
00:20:42,870 --> 00:20:43,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Look, boss,</b></font>

459
00:20:44,120 --> 00:20:46,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-I need to tell you--
-[cell phone ringing]</b></font>

460
00:20:57,590 --> 00:21:00,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm sorry,
I haven't offered you a drink.</b></font>

461
00:21:00,090 --> 00:21:02,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] I'm good with anything
really, other than liquor.</b></font>

462
00:21:02,970 --> 00:21:05,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HAKARI] What?
Can't handle it or something?</b></font>

463
00:21:05,350 --> 00:21:08,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] No.
It's just, I'm still underage.</b></font>

464
00:21:08,100 --> 00:21:10,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You don't strike me as
the type to care about that.</b></font>

465
00:21:10,640 --> 00:21:13,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Did you know Gojo
can't hold his liquor either?</b></font>

466
00:21:13,690 --> 00:21:15,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah? Who's Gojo?</b></font>

467
00:21:16,190 --> 00:21:18,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And I never said that I can't,
just that I haven't.</b></font>

468
00:21:18,780 --> 00:21:20,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-So why the act?
-Huh?</b></font>

469
00:21:20,820 --> 00:21:22,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[cell phone continues ringing]</b></font>

470
00:21:28,700 --> 00:21:32,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There isn't a single sorcerer
who hasn't heard of Satoru Gojo.</b></font>

471
00:21:32,250 --> 00:21:34,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So why did you feign ignorance?</b></font>

472
00:21:34,170 --> 00:21:35,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Were you...</b></font>

473
00:21:36,550 --> 00:21:38,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gulping]</b></font>

474
00:21:41,470 --> 00:21:43,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[slams]
-...sent by Jujutsu High?</b></font>

475
00:21:49,980 --> 00:21:52,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-L-Listen. [yelps]
-[glass shatters]</b></font>

476
00:21:52,390 --> 00:21:53,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey! Hey!</b></font>

477
00:21:53,600 --> 00:21:55,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuji groans]</b></font>

478
00:21:55,820 --> 00:21:58,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>When I get a call
from Kirara's phone,</b></font>

479
00:21:58,610 --> 00:22:00,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it's a signal
something's fishy.</b></font>

480
00:22:01,740 --> 00:22:02,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

481
00:22:03,110 --> 00:22:05,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-Listen!
-Save it, kid!</b></font>

482
00:22:05,200 --> 00:22:06,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My passion has gone cold!</b></font>

483
00:22:06,870 --> 00:22:09,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>EPISODE 52 PASSION</b></font>

484
00:22:10,290 --> 00:22:12,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b></font>

485
00:23:40,590 --> 00:23:42,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] If we can convince
them, negotiations with Hakari</b></font>

486
00:23:42,670 --> 00:23:43,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>will go more smoothly.</b></font>

487
00:23:44,010 --> 00:23:45,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[PANDA] Wait, Kirara!
-[YUJI] Stay out of this.</b></font>

488
00:23:45,970 --> 00:23:48,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HAKARI] You have to show me!
Right here and now!</b></font>

489
00:23:48,970 --> 00:23:50,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] Wait.
There's no time to waste.</b></font>

490
00:23:50,720 --> 00:23:52,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KIRARA] Kin! He's in danger!</b></font>

491
00:23:52,720 --> 00:23:54,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>NEXT EPISODE
COG</b></font>

